    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Mutton rogan josh serves 4 and takes about 110 minutes. Brown the lamb well first for a deep colour and flavour. The "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "ghee",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "ghee"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " and slow simmer do the rest."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Whisk the yoghurt before adding so it blends in smoothly without splitting."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
